              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Monica"
            },
            "reviewBody": "As posted it's ok, but why not add more of your favorite veggies?- by passed celery salt and sliced up a celery stalk; added 1 cup each blanched broccoli and cauliflower ( chopped). As well as 4-6 sliced radishes and 1)2 cup sliced black olives I would rather serve it this way .. and I do..so much more veggies.",
